  m_text: '<color=#25BCBC>TEAL</color>     Either ship can push

    <color=#FFFF40>YELLOW</color> 
    Atlas is needed

    <color=#E04040>RED</color>       Too heavy for either


    Weight
    = number of occupied cells.

    A push counts the whole chain,

    including
    blocks resting on top.

    Unsupported blocks fall.

    Blocks never rotate
    or merge.'
