  m_text: 'Lift by moving up below a block.

    A load supported only by your ship

    travels
    with it in all directions.


    Move down onto a ledge to set it down.

    Move
    sideways against a wall to

    release the block and slide away.


    A ceiling
    or excess weight stops a lift.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 92e34a4db2d9b8e4a935f02188007e6d, type: 2}
