  m_text: '<color=#E0A040>KESTREL  /  2 x 2 cells</color>

    Small and fast. Fits
    narrow gaps

    and handles lighter loads.


    <color=#E0A040>ATLAS  /  4
    x 2 cells</color>

    Larger and slower. Moves heavier

    loads to clear the
    way.


    Both ships hover when stopped.'
