  m_text: 'Overloaded? A crush ring counts down.

    Release the load or switch
    ships

    to push it away before time runs out.


    A crush costs one of your
    3 lives.

    A blinking ghost waits for its start

    area to clear before
    returning.


    No lives or no oxygen = level failed.'
